{"timestamp":"2026-05-26T23:27:40.839Z","ordinal":26,"type":"response_item","payload":{"type":"function_call_output","call_id":"call_i7O54hoWJ6A8KpHYTK5kzzxx","output":"Chunk ID: 20bb0d\nWall time: 0.0000 seconds\nProcess exited with code 0\nOriginal token count: 9198\nOutput:\n1822\n01:50:55,023 --> 01:50:57,985\nthis is what\nyou've been up to.\n\n1823\n01:50:58,777 --> 01:50:59,945\nYes.\n\n1824\n01:51:00,112 --> 01:51:02,030\nWhat you have here, now,\n\n1825\n01:51:03,282 --> 01:51:07,494\nis a chance to restore\nWakanda's protector.\n\n1826\n01:51:07,578 --> 01:51:13,000\n(SCOFFS IN DISBELIEF)\nIt would be the greatest gift\n\n1827\n01:51:13,458 --> 01:51:15,794\nsince Bashenga's discovery.\n\n1828\n01:51:20,924 --> 01:51:23,177\nWe'll soon find out. Come.\n\n1829\n01:51:26,305 --> 01:51:27,764\n-GRIOT?\n-GRIOT: Yes, Princess.\n\n1830\n01:51:27,848 --> 01:51:28,932\nSHURI: Print it.\n\n1831\n01:51:33,103 --> 01:51:34,813\nNAKIA: How will we know\nif it works?\n\n1832\n01:51:35,606 --> 01:51:36,857\nSHURI: If it glows.\n\n1833\n01:51:43,197 --> 01:51:44,448\n(BOTH GASP)\n\n1834\n01:51:45,991 --> 01:51:47,159\n(IN XHOSA)\n\n1835\n01:51:48,285 --> 01:51:49,703\n(NAKIA LAUGHS)\n\n1836\n01:51:51,914 --> 01:51:52,998\n(IN ENGLISH) I mean,\nshouldn't we be\n\n1837\n01:51:53,081 --> 01:51:54,374\nburning incense or something?\n\n1838\n01:51:55,000 --> 01:51:56,084\nOnly Bast knows\n\n1839\n01:51:56,168 --> 01:51:58,170\nhow the ancestors\nwill make it to this lab.\n\n1840\n01:52:08,513 --> 01:52:10,349\nAre you sure you don't want me\nto bury you?\n\n1841\n01:52:10,515 --> 01:52:11,516\nNo.\n\n1842\n01:52:12,100 --> 01:52:14,144\nNeed you to have access\nto my chest,\n\n1843\n01:52:14,311 --> 01:52:16,355\njust in case\nI go through cardiac arrest.\n\n1844\n01:52:16,939 --> 01:52:18,482\n\"Cardiac arrest\"?\n\n1845\n01:52:19,566 --> 01:52:20,609\nShe's joking,\n\n1846\n01:52:21,151 --> 01:52:22,402\nright?\n\n1847\n01:52:23,570 --> 01:52:25,405\n-(KIMOYO BEADS TRILL)\n-Right?\n\n1848\n01:52:26,907 --> 01:52:29,076\n(SIGHS DEEPLY)\n\n1849\n01:52:30,369 --> 01:52:34,206\nAllow this Heart-Shaped Herb\n\n1850\n01:52:34,581 --> 01:52:37,626\nto give you the strength\nof the Black Panther\n\n1851\n01:52:38,043 --> 01:52:40,462\nand take you\nto the Ancestral Plane.\n\n1852\n01:52:44,716 --> 01:52:46,051\n(IN XHOSA)\n\n1853\n01:52:49,805 --> 01:52:52,057\n(SUSPENSEFUL MUSIC BUILDING)\n\n1854\n01:52:54,309 --> 01:52:55,310\n(MUSIC STOPS)\n\n1855\n01:52:57,646 --> 01:52:58,981\n(NAKIA CHANTS IN XHOSA)\n\n1856\n01:53:00,649 --> 01:53:02,192\n(NAKIA AND RIRI\nCHANTING IN XHOSA)\n\n1857\n01:53:02,276 --> 01:53:03,986\n(HEART BEATING)\n\n1858\n01:53:10,284 --> 01:53:11,285\n(HEARTBEAT STOPS)\n\n1859\n01:53:31,930 --> 01:53:33,432\n(PANTING)\n\n1860\n01:53:33,515 --> 01:53:35,851\n(LOW EERIE MUSIC PLAYING)\n\n1861\n01:53:59,750 --> 01:54:00,751\n(IN ENGLISH) Mother?\n\n1862\n01:54:14,097 --> 01:54:15,349\nN'Jadaka.\n\n1863\n01:54:15,932 --> 01:54:17,100\nLil' cousin.\n\n1864\n01:54:17,476 --> 01:54:18,477\nHow?\n\n1865\n01:54:18,560 --> 01:54:21,396\nHow is never as important\nas why, right?\n\n1866\n01:54:23,190 --> 01:54:24,441\nYou chose me.\n\n1867\n01:54:24,608 --> 01:54:27,486\nImpossible.\nI would never choose you.\n\n1868\n01:54:27,652 --> 01:54:29,321\nWhy did you take the Herb?\n\n1869\n01:54:30,322 --> 01:54:32,282\n-To see my family.\n-No, that's bullshit.\n\n1870\n01:54:33,241 --> 01:54:35,160\nYou didn't believe\nthe Ancestral Plane was real,\n\n1871\n01:54:35,243 --> 01:54:36,244\ndid you?\n\n1872\n01:54:39,373 --> 01:54:40,374\nNo.\n\n1873\n01:54:41,124 --> 01:54:42,376\nSo, why did you take it, then?\n\n1874\n01:54:44,086 --> 01:54:45,462\nYou don't have to lie to me.\n\n1875\n01:54:46,296 --> 01:54:47,798\nSo I can be strong.\n\n1876\n01:54:48,173 --> 01:54:49,674\nStrong to do what?\n\n1877\n01:54:52,552 --> 01:54:53,553\nSee?\n\n1878\n01:54:55,097 --> 01:54:57,057\nWe're more alike\nthan you think.\n\n1879\n01:54:58,975 --> 01:55:00,936\nI took it to avenge\nmy ancestors too.\n\n1880\n01:55:01,103 --> 01:55:02,270\nI'm nothing like you.\n\n1881\n01:55:03,730 --> 01:55:05,482\nYou took it for yourself,\n\n1882\n01:55:05,649 --> 01:55:07,192\nthen destroyed the rest.\n\n1883\n01:55:08,693 --> 01:55:09,903\nUnworthy king,\n\n1884\n01:55:10,737 --> 01:55:12,239\nafraid of being replaced.\n\n1885\n01:55:13,323 --> 01:55:14,324\nJust a coward.\n\n1886\n01:55:14,491 --> 01:55:15,492\nNo.\n\n1887\n01:55:15,575 --> 01:55:16,618\nI had the courage to do\n\n1888\n01:55:16,701 --> 01:55:18,245\nwhat was necessary\nto change Wakanda.\n\n1889\n01:55:19,663 --> 01:55:21,164\nHow many people\nlike your scientist\n\n1890\n01:55:21,248 --> 01:55:23,625\ndid Wakanda protect\nbefore I took the throne?\n\n1891\n01:55:24,668 --> 01:55:25,669\nCowards.\n\n1892\n01:55:25,836 --> 01:55:28,088\nThat was the Panthers\nthat came before me,\n\n1893\n01:55:29,172 --> 01:55:30,173\nand before T'Challa.\n\n1894\n01:55:30,257 --> 01:55:32,092\nDon't mention my brother.\n\n1895\n01:55:32,426 --> 01:55:34,094\nYou're the reason\nwhy he's dead.\n\n1896\n01:55:34,594 --> 01:55:37,848\nYou burnt the Herb,\nleft us with no protector.\n\n1897\n01:55:38,014 --> 01:55:40,267\nThen Namor struck\nand killed my mother.\n\n1898\n01:55:40,434 --> 01:55:42,269\nTheir blood is on your hands.\n\n1899\n01:55:43,437 --> 01:55:44,771\nThat ain't on me.\n\n1900\n01:55:45,313 --> 01:55:46,690\nAnd don't you dare\n\n1901\n01:55:46,857 --> 01:55:48,692\ntake that away\nfrom your mother.\n\n1902\n01:55:48,859 --> 01:55:50,444\nShe sacrificed her life\nto protect\n\n1903\n01:55:50,527 --> 01:55:52,362\na young girl\nfrom the lost tribe.\n\n1904\n01:55:53,738 --> 01:55:56,408\nYour father,\nhe was a hypocrite.\n\n1905\n01:55:57,909 --> 01:55:59,661\nHe would've killed that girl.\n\n1906\n01:56:00,370 --> 01:56:02,289\nShit, he killed\nhis own brother.\n\n1907\n01:56:03,874 --> 01:56:06,543\nT'Challa was too noble.\n\n1908\n01:56:08,712 --> 01:56:11,047\nHe let the man\nwho murdered your father live.\n\n1909\n01:56:13,175 --> 01:56:14,843\nAnd here you stand.\n\n1910\n01:56:20,515 --> 01:56:22,642\nAre you gonna be noble\nlike your brother\n\n1911\n01:56:22,809 --> 01:56:24,895\nor take care of business...\n\n1912\n01:56:25,604 --> 01:56:26,730\nlike me?\n\n1913\n01:56:28,398 --> 01:56:29,483\n(YELPS)\n\n1914\n01:56:29,566 --> 01:56:30,567\nNAKIA: Are you okay?\n\n1915\n01:56:30,984 --> 01:56:32,652\n(GASPING)\n\n1916\n01:56:32,736 --> 01:56:33,904\n(IN XHOSA)\n\n1917\n01:56:36,448 --> 01:56:37,532\n(IN ENGLISH) Who did you see?\n\n1918\n01:56:43,038 --> 01:56:44,039\nNo one.\n\n1919\n01:56:47,292 --> 01:56:48,293\n(IN XHOSA)\n\n1920\n01:56:48,919 --> 01:56:50,337\n(IN ENGLISH) I failed.\n\n1921\n01:56:50,504 --> 01:56:52,631\n-It didn't work.\n-Hey, Shuri.\n\n1922\n01:56:55,759 --> 01:56:58,136\n-They abandoned me.\n-They would never do that.\n\n1923\n01:56:58,220 --> 01:56:59,763\nI did everything\nI was supposed to do.\n\n1924\n01:56:59,846 --> 01:57:01,681\n-I re-created the Herb.\n-Okay.\n\n1925\n01:57:01,765 --> 01:57:03,808\nI just did your stupid ritual,\nand for what?\n\n1926\n01:57:03,975 --> 01:57:05,519\n-Relax.\n-Why didn't they come for me?\n\n1927\n01:57:05,602 --> 01:57:06,728\nJust relax.\n\n1928\n01:57:09,481 --> 01:57:10,941\n(GRUNTS IN FRUSTRATION)\n\n1929\n01:57:13,818 --> 01:57:15,111\nBOTH: Shit.\n\n1930\n01:57:19,449 --> 01:57:20,784\nCan I get some of that too?\n\n1931\n01:57:28,208 --> 01:57:29,251\nI think...\n\n1932\n01:57:30,794 --> 01:57:32,254\nyou're going to need a suit.\n\n1933\n01:57:35,507 --> 01:57:37,717\n(PENSIVE MUSIC PLAYING)\n\n1934\n01:57:51,147 --> 01:57:53,483\n(SLOW SYNTH MUSIC PLAYING)\n\n1935\n01:58:03,868 --> 01:58:05,870\nTRIBE ELDER 1: There are more\npeople coming from the city.\n\n1936\n01:58:05,954 --> 01:58:07,581\nM'BAKU: They need more space.\n\n1937\n01:58:07,747 --> 01:58:08,748\nSo what?\n\n1938\n01:58:09,624 --> 01:58:11,876\nYou are visitors.\n\n1939\n01:58:12,043 --> 01:58:15,255\nIt is a wonder how anything\ngets done with you people.\n\n1940\n01:58:15,338 --> 01:58:16,339\n(FALTERS)\n\n1941\n01:58:17,173 --> 01:58:18,675\n(ENGINE HUMMING)\n\n1942\n01:58:24,806 --> 01:58:27,017\n(SLOW SYNTH MUSIC PLAYING)\n\n1943\n01:58:40,405 --> 01:58:42,699\n-(ALL EXCLAIM)\n-TRIBE ELDER 2: The princess!\n\n1944\n01:58:53,668 --> 01:58:55,128\n(M'BAKU CLEARS THROAT)\n\n1945\n01:58:57,047 --> 01:58:59,382\n(JABARIS HOOTING)\n\n1946\n01:59:02,510 --> 01:59:04,512\n(MUSIC INTENSIFIES)\n\n1947\n01:59:04,596 --> 01:59:06,097\n(HOOTING CONTINUES)\n\n1948\n01:59:13,021 --> 01:59:14,314\n(HOOTING SUBSIDES)\n\n1949\n01:59:16,232 --> 01:59:17,525\nM'BAKU: She has done it!\n\n1950\n01:59:18,234 --> 01:59:21,237\n-The Black Panther lives!\n-(JABARIS ULULATING)\n\n1951\n01:59:21,321 --> 01:59:24,324\n-(JABARIS CHANTING)\n-(ZAWAVARI SINGING IN XHOSA)\n\n1952\n01:59:28,370 --> 01:59:30,538\n(JABARIS CONTINUE CHANTING)\n\n1953\n01:59:39,089 --> 01:59:41,508\nNamor believes\nWakanda is on her knees.\n\n1954\n01:59:43,968 --> 01:59:45,428\nOur Queen murdered.\n\n1955\n01:59:47,931 --> 01:59:49,474\nOur capital destroyed.\n\n1956\n01:59:51,142 --> 01:59:52,977\nHe believes\nwe have no protector.\n\n1957\n01:59:54,979 --> 01:59:55,980\nBut now...\n\n1958\n01:59:57,774 --> 01:59:59,776\nnow is our time to strike.\n\n1959\n01:59:59,943 --> 02:00:03,530\nELDER: How, when we don't\neven know how to find him?\n\n1960\n02:00:04,114 --> 02:00:05,824\nWe'll bring Namor to us.\n\n1961\n02:00:05,990 --> 02:00:07,534\n-Here, again?\n-SHURI: No.\n\n1962\n02:00:07,701 --> 02:00:10,036\nA distant location at sea.\n\n1963\n02:00:10,203 --> 02:00:11,621\nM'BAKU: All right.\n\n1964\n02:00:11,705 --> 02:00:13,164\nLet's say this does work.\n\n1965\n02:00:14,457 --> 02:00:17,210\nHmm. Assuming\nwe can kill this man\n\n1966\n02:00:17,377 --> 02:00:20,422\nwho can fly and is potentially\nas strong as the Hulk...\n\n1967\n02:00:23,174 --> 02:00:25,593\nis murdering him\nthe right solution?\n\n1968\n02:00:26,052 --> 02:00:28,012\nTRIBE ELDER 2:\nYou were calling for his head\n\n1969\n02:00:28,179 --> 02:00:30,515\nwhen his only crime\nwas intimidation.\n\n1970\n02:00:30,682 --> 02:00:32,475\nWhat has changed, Lord M'Baku?\n\n1971\n02:00:32,642 --> 02:00:33,852\nHis soldiers\n\n1972\n02:00:34,018 --> 02:00:35,729\ndid not call him\nGeneral or King.\n\n1973\n02:00:35,812 --> 02:00:38,481\nThey called him K'uk'ulkan.\n\n1974\n02:00:38,648 --> 02:00:39,858\nWhat is that?\n\n1975\n02:00:40,024 --> 02:00:42,152\nThe feather serpent god.\n\n1976\n02:00:42,736 --> 02:00:43,737\nWhat?\n\n1977\n02:00:43,820 --> 02:00:45,822\nDo you think because we are\nliving in the mountains,\n\n1978\n02:00:45,989 --> 02:00:47,866\nwe do not have access\nto books?\n\n1979\n02:00:48,116 --> 02:00:49,617\n-(CHUCKLES)\n-SHURI: Elders,\n\n1980\n02:00:50,034 --> 02:00:51,411\nwith your permission,\n\n1981\n02:00:51,578 --> 02:00:55,290\nI would like to talk\nwith Lord M'Baku alone.\n\n1982\n02:00:56,666 --> 02:00:57,667\n(ELDERS SPEAKING XHOSA)\n\n1983\n02:01:05,425 --> 02:01:06,760\n(IN ENGLISH)\nNamor's not finished.\n\n1984\n02:01:08,178 --> 02:01:11,264\nHe promised to destroy\nthe surface world.\n\n1985\n02:01:11,431 --> 02:01:13,767\nNow is our opportunity\nto take him.\n\n1986\n02:01:13,933 --> 02:01:16,186\n-What are you afraid of?\n-M'BAKU: War.\n\n1987\n02:01:16,603 --> 02:01:19,939\nIf Namor is indeed\na god to his people,\n\n1988\n02:01:20,106 --> 02:01:22,734\nkilling him\nwill risk eternal war.\n\n1989\n02:01:22,817 --> 02:01:23,985\nSHURI: And so what?\n\n1990\n02:01:24,527 --> 02:01:26,863\nWas my mother's life\nnot worth eternal war?\n\n1991\n02:01:27,030 --> 02:01:28,406\nM'BAKU: Of course it was.\n\n1992\n02:01:29,407 --> 02:01:33,495\nOf course she was.\n\n1993\n02:01:35,497 --> 02:01:38,708\nBut it is not what she would\nhave wanted for you.\n\n1994\n02:01:39,959 --> 02:01:40,960\nHmm?\n\n1995\n02:01:44,172 --> 02:01:45,882\nAnd it is not what I want...\n\n1996\n02:01:48,510 --> 02:01:50,261\nfor my people.\n\n1997\n02:01:58,228 --> 02:02:00,522\n(SOMBER MUSIC PLAYING)\n\n1998\n02:02:00,605 --> 02:02:03,650\nYou speak of my mother\nas if she's still here.\n\n1999\n02:02:04,567 --> 02:02:06,569\nOf what she would've\nwanted for me.\n\n2000\n02:02:07,654 --> 02:02:09,948\nHer hopes and her dreams.\n\n2001\n02:02:13,117 --> 02:02:14,619\nBut she's dead.\n\n2002\n02:02:15,662 --> 02:02:16,663\nShe's gone!\n\n2003\n02:02:18,373 --> 02:02:22,252\nNamor drowned her,\nright in front of me!\n\n2004\n02:02:23,670 --> 02:02:24,963\nSo, her dreams,\n\n2005\n02:02:25,129 --> 02:02:28,216\nher goals, her hopes for me...\n\n2006\n02:02:31,553 --> 02:02:32,804\nit doesn't exist.\n\n2007\n02:02:35,515 --> 02:02:37,058\nIt doesn't matter anymore.\n\n2008\n02:02:39,143 --> 02:02:42,021\nWhat matters is what I want,\n\n2009\n02:02:42,188 --> 02:02:44,899\nand what I want is Namor dead!\n\n2010\n02:02:48,903 --> 02:02:50,572\nAnd you're going\nto help me get it.\n\n2011\n02:02:58,121 --> 02:02:59,289\n(IN XHOSA)\n\n2012\n02:03:04,002 --> 02:03:05,128\n(GRUNTS)\n\n2013\n02:03:06,838 --> 02:03:08,464\n(IN ENGLISH)\nWe leave in the morning.\n\n2014\n02:03:11,050 --> 02:03:13,261\n(TENSE PERCUSSION MUSIC\nPLAYING)\n\n2015\n02:03:34,282 --> 02:03:35,283\nNAKIA: Hi.\n\n2016\n02:03:35,450 --> 02:03:36,451\nGood morning.\n\n2017\n02:03:39,078 --> 02:03:40,288\nIf we survive this,\n\n2018\n02:03:41,956 --> 02:03:45,168\nI want you to know you have\na home with me in Haiti.\n\n2019\n02:03:48,004 --> 02:03:50,340\nHere. Take my hands.\n\n2020\n02:03:52,133 --> 02:03:53,551\n(SHURI EXHALES)\n\n2021\n02:03:53,635 --> 02:03:54,636\n(IN XHOSA)\n\n2022\n02:03:55,803 --> 02:03:57,221\n(BREATHES DEEPLY)\n\n2023\n02:03:59,015 --> 02:04:01,517\n(IN ENGLISH) Shuri, I want you\nto be honest with me.\n\n2024\n02:04:01,684 --> 02:04:04,729\nWho did you see\nwhen you took the Herb?\n\n2025\n02:04:09,901 --> 02:04:11,611\nIf you go to w