:03,883\n+Toussaint est un tres beau nom.\n+\n+2383\n+02:33:04,384 --> 02:33:06,511\n+Il porte une grande histoire.\n+\n+2384\n+02:33:06,678 --> 02:33:09,972\n+Merci. Le tien est cool aussi,\n+je suppose.\n+\n+2385\n+02:33:10,223 --> 02:33:12,225\n+(TOUS DEUX RIENT)\n+\n+2386\n+02:33:13,267 --> 02:33:15,436\n+Maman dit que tu sais bien\n+garder les secrets.\n+\n+2387\n+02:33:15,520 --> 02:33:16,521\n+C'est vrai ?\n+\n+2388\n+02:33:17,772 --> 02:33:20,566\n+Oui, je sais garder\n+un vrai secret.\n+\n+2389\n+02:33:23,569 --> 02:33:25,863\n+Toussaint est mon nom haitien.\n+\n+2390\n+02:33:28,825 --> 02:33:29,992\n+(EN XHOSA)\n+\n+2391\n+02:33:30,910 --> 02:33:33,121\n+(EN ANGLAIS)\n+Je m'appelle le Prince T'Challa,\n+\n+2392\n+02:33:33,204 --> 02:33:35,123\n+fils du Roi T'Challa.\n+\n+2393\n+02:33:35,748 --> 02:33:37,959\n+(MUSIQUE DOUCE)\n+\n+2394\n+02:33:43,381 --> 02:33:44,549\n+(SHURI RENIFLE)\n+\n+2395\n+02:33:50,096 --> 02:33:51,305\n+(RIT DOUCEMENT)\n+\n+2396\n+02:34:04,610 --> 02:34:07,029\n+(LA MUSIQUE DOUCE CONTINUE)\n+\n+2397\n+02:34:33,389 --> 02:34:35,725\n+(MUSIQUE HEROIQUE)\n+\n+2398\n+02:34:53,951 --> 02:34:56,370\n+(BORN AGAIN DE RIHANNA)\n+\n+2399\n+02:35:02,376 --> 02:35:08,090\n+Je donne mon coeur a ce lieu\n+\n+2400\n+02:35:10,426 --> 02:35:16,808\n+Je donne mon ame\n+ou tout ce qu'il faudra\n+\n+2401\n+02:35:16,891 --> 02:35:18,976\n+Ne jamais fuir\n+\n+2402\n+02:35:19,060 --> 02:35:25,233\n+J'ai assez d'anges\n+pour prendre les portes d'assaut\n+\n+2403\n+02:35:25,316 --> 02:35:27,318\n+Je n'ai pas peur\n+\n+2404\n+02:35:27,401 --> 02:35:31,447\n+Regardez les braves\n+\n+2405\n+02:35:31,531 --> 02:35:35,326\n+Et je ne veux rien d'autre\n+\n+2406\n+02:35:35,409 --> 02:35:41,374\n+J'ai manque ton apparition\n+et ces instants avec toi\n+\n+2407\n+02:35:41,499 --> 02:35:45,461\n+Ce simple reflet de moi\n+\n+2408\n+02:35:45,545 --> 02:35:49,382\n+Ce miroir ne peut changer\n+son regard\n+\n+2409\n+02:35:49,465 --> 02:35:52,301\n+Alors jusqu'a ce que\n+ces rivieres s'epuisent\n+\n+2410\n+02:35:52,385 --> 02:35:57,932\n+Ca coule en moi\n+ou que tu sois\n+\n+2411\n+02:35:58,015 --> 02:35:59,851\n+Je serai la\n+\n+2412\n+02:36:01,102 --> 02:36:04,272\n+Nous continuons\n+\n+2413\n+02:36:06,482 --> 02:36:07,984\n+Renaître\n+\n+2414\n+02:36:08,067 --> 02:36:12,321\n+Je donne mon coeur a ce lieu\n+\n+2415\n+02:36:12,405 --> 02:36:15,783\n+Je donne mon coeur a ce lieu\n+\n+2416\n+02:36:15,867 --> 02:36:22,164\n+Je donne toute mon ame\n+et tout ce qu'il faudra\n+\n+2417\n+02:36:22,540 --> 02:36:24,166\n+Ne jamais fuir\n+\n+2418\n+02:36:24,292 --> 02:36:27,295\n+Et je revivrais tout ca\n+\n+2419\n+02:36:27,378 --> 02:36:32,508\n+rien que pour revoir ton visage\n+\n+2420\n+02:36:32,592 --> 02:36:38,139\n+Je sais que tu ferais pareil\n+\n+2421\n+02:36:39,265 --> 02:36:40,766\n+Renaître\n+\n+2422\n+02:36:40,850 --> 02:36:46,105\n+Dis-moi seulement\n+ce que je dois faire\n+\n+2423\n+02:36:48,983 --> 02:36:54,488\n+Je mourrais et reviendrais\n+juste pour t'aimer\n+\n+2424\n+02:36:57,241 --> 02:37:03,915\n+Dis-le-moi seulement\n+Je t'en supplie\n+\n+2425\n+02:37:05,458 --> 02:37:11,297\n+Dis-moi seulement\n+ce que je dois faire\n+\n+2426\n+02:37:12,256 --> 02:37:13,883\n+Oh\n+\n+2427\n+02:37:14,342 --> 02:37:16,510\n+(VOCALISES ET CHANTS)\n+\n+2428\n+02:38:24,161 --> 02:38:26,956\n+(LAAYLI' KUXA'ANO'ONE\n+D'ADN MAYA)\n*** End Patch\n"}}
{"timestamp":"2026-05-26T23:34:01.875Z","ordinal":33,"type":"event_msg","payload":{"type":"item_completed","thread_id":"019e669c-f8e5-7ff0-a93a-cb14a4c918c0","turn_id":"019e669c-f920-74a3-ae52-ba85674df2e4","item":{"type":"FileChange","id":"call_yjn49f4D8Jma6GxnNB2qzZmw","changes":{"/Users/zenray/Downloads/WakandaForever_subtitles_work/chunks/wakanda_forever.fr.chunk4.srt":{"type":"add","content":"1822\n01:50:55,023 --> 01:50:57,985\nvoila donc a quoi\ntu travaillais.\n\n1823\n01:50:58,777 --> 01:50:59,945\nOui.\n\n1824\n01:51:00,112 --> 01:51:02,030\nCe que tu as la, maintenant,\n\n1825\n01:51:03,282 --> 01:51:07,494\nc'est une chance de ramener\nla protectrice du Wakanda.\n\n1826\n01:51:07,578 --> 01:51:13,000\n(RICANE, INCREDULE)\nCe serait le plus beau cadeau\n\n1827\n01:51:13,458 --> 01:51:15,794\ndepuis la decouverte de Bashenga.\n\n1828\n01:51:20,924 --> 01:51:23,177\nNous le saurons bientot. Viens.\n\n1829\n01:51:26,305 --> 01:51:27,764\n-GRIOT ?\n-GRIOT : Oui, Princesse.\n\n1830\n01:51:27,848 --> 01:51:28,932\nSHURI : Imprime-la.\n\n1831\n01:51:33,103 --> 01:51:34,813\nNAKIA : Comment saurons-nous\nsi ca marche ?\n\n1832\n01:51:35,606 --> 01:51:36,857\nSHURI : Si elle brille.\n\n1833\n01:51:43,197 --> 01:51:44,448\n(ELLES SURSAUTENT)\n\n1834\n01:51:45,991 --> 01:51:47,159\n(EN XHOSA)\n\n1835\n01:51:48,285 --> 01:51:49,703\n(NAKIA RIT)\n\n1836\n01:51:51,914 --> 01:51:52,998\n(EN ANGLAIS) Je veux dire,\non ne devrait pas\n\n1837\n01:51:53,081 --> 01:51:54,374\nbruler de l'encens ou autre ?\n\n1838\n01:51:55,000 --> 01:51:56,084\nSeule Bast sait\n\n1839\n01:51:56,168 --> 01:51:58,170\ncomment les Ancetres\nvont arriver jusqu'ici.\n\n1840\n01:52:08,513 --> 01:52:10,349\nTu es sure que tu ne veux pas\nque je t'enterre ?\n\n1841\n01:52:10,515 --> 01:52:11,516\nNon.\n\n1842\n01:52:12,100 --> 01:52:14,144\nIl faut que tu puisses acceder\na ma poitrine,\n\n1843\n01:52:14,311 --> 01:52:16,355\nau cas ou je ferais\nun arret cardiaque.\n\n1844\n01:52:16,939 --> 01:52:18,482\n\"Un arret cardiaque\" ?\n\n1845\n01:52:19,566 --> 01:52:20,609\nElle plaisante,\n\n1846\n01:52:21,151 --> 01:52:22,402\nhein ?\n\n1847\n01:52:23,570 --> 01:52:25,405\n-(LES PERLES KIMOYO VIBRENT)\n-Hein ?\n\n1848\n01:52:26,907 --> 01:52:29,076\n(LONG SOUPIR)\n\n1849\n01:52:30,369 --> 01:52:34,206\nQue cette Herbe-Coeur\n\n1850\n01:52:34,581 --> 01:52:37,626\nte donne la force\nde la Black Panther\n\n1851\n01:52:38,043 --> 01:52:40,462\net te mene\nau Plan ancestral.\n\n1852\n01:52:44,716 --> 01:52:46,051\n(EN XHOSA)\n\n1853\n01:52:49,805 --> 01:52:52,057\n(LA MUSIQUE DE SUSPENSE MONTE)\n\n1854\n01:52:54,309 --> 01:52:55,310\n(LA MUSIQUE S'ARRETE)\n\n1855\n01:52:57,646 --> 01:52:58,981\n(NAKIA CHANTE EN XHOSA)\n\n1856\n01:53:00,649 --> 01:53:02,192\n(NAKIA ET RIRI\nCHANTENT EN XHOSA)\n\n1857\n01:53:02,276 --> 01:53:03,986\n(BATTEMENTS DE COEUR)\n\n1858\n01:53:10,284 --> 01:53:11,285\n(LE COEUR S'ARRETE)\n\n1859\n01:53:31,930 --> 01:53:33,432\n(HALETE)\n\n1860\n01:53:33,515 --> 01:53:35,851\n(MUSIQUE SOURDE ET INQUIETANTE)\n\n1861\n01:53:59,750 --> 01:54:00,751\n(EN ANGLAIS) Mere ?\n\n1862\n01:54:14,097 --> 01:54:15,349\nN'Jadaka.\n\n1863\n01:54:15,932 --> 01:54:17,100\nPetite cousine.\n\n1864\n01:54:17,476 --> 01:54:18,477\nComment ?\n\n1865\n01:54:18,560 --> 01:54:21,396\nLe comment compte moins\nque le pourquoi, non ?\n\n1866\n01:54:23,190 --> 01:54:24,441\nTu m'as choisi.\n\n1867\n01:54:24,608 --> 01:54:27,486\nImpossible.\nJe ne te choisirais jamais.\n\n1868\n01:54:27,652 --> 01:54:29,321\nPourquoi as-tu pris l'Herbe ?\n\n1869\n01:54:30,322 --> 01:54:32,282\n-Pour voir ma famille.\n-Non, conneries.\n\n1870\n01:54:33,241 --> 01:54:35,160\nTu ne croyais pas\nau Plan ancestral,\n\n1871\n01:54:35,243 --> 01:54:36,244\nsi ?\n\n1872\n01:54:39,373 --> 01:54:40,374\nNon.\n\n1873\n01:54:41,124 --> 01:54:42,376\nAlors pourquoi l'avoir prise ?\n\n1874\n01:54:44,086 --> 01:54:45,462\nPas besoin de me mentir.\n\n1875\n01:54:46,296 --> 01:54:47,798\nPour etre forte.\n\n1876\n01:54:48,173 --> 01:54:49,674\nForte pour faire quoi ?\n\n1877\n01:54:52,552 --> 01:54:53,553\nTu vois ?\n\n1878\n01:54:55,097 --> 01:54:57,057\nOn se ressemble plus\nque tu ne le crois.\n\n1879\n01:54:58,975 --> 01:55:00,936\nMoi aussi, je l'ai prise\npour venger mes Ancetres.\n\n1880\n01:55:01,103 --> 01:55:02,270\nJe ne suis pas comme toi.\n\n1881\n01:55:03,730 --> 01:55:05,482\nTu l'as prise pour toi,\n\n1882\n01:55:05,649 --> 01:55:07,192\npuis tu as detruit le reste.\n\n1883\n01:55:08,693 --> 01:55:09,903\nRoi indigne,\n\n1884\n01:55:10,737 --> 01:55:12,239\nterrifié d'etre remplace.\n\n1885\n01:55:13,323 --> 01:55:14,324\nUn lache.\n\n1886\n01:55:14,491 --> 01:55:15,492\nNon.\n\n1887\n01:55:15,575 --> 01:55:16,618\nJ'ai eu le courage\n\n1888\n01:55:16,701 --> 01:55:18,245\nde faire le necessaire\npour changer Wakanda.\n\n1889\n01:55:19,663 --> 01:55:21,164\nCombien de gens\ncomme ta scientifique\n\n1890\n01:55:21,248 --> 01:55:23,625\nWakanda a-t-il proteges\navant mon regne ?\n\n1891\n01:55:24,668 --> 01:55:25,669\nDes laches.\n\n1892\n01:55:25,836 --> 01:55:28,088\nC'etaient les Pantheres\nvenues avant moi,\n\n1893\n01:55:29,172 --> 01:55:30,173\net avant T'Challa.\n\n1894\n01:55:30,257 --> 01:55:32,092\nNe parle pas de mon frere.\n\n1895\n01:55:32,426 --> 01:55:34,094\nC'est a cause de toi\nqu'il est mort.\n\n1896\n01:55:34,594 --> 01:55:37,848\nTu as brule l'Herbe,\ntu nous as prives de protecteur.\n\n1897\n01:55:38,014 --> 01:55:40,267\nPuis Namor a frappe\net tue ma mere.\n\n1898\n01:55:40,434 --> 01:55:42,269\nLeur sang est sur tes mains.\n\n1899\n01:55:43,437 --> 01:55:44,771\nCa, c'est pas ma faute.\n\n1900\n01:55:45,313 --> 01:55:46,690\nEt n'ose surtout pas\n\n1901\n01:55:46,857 --> 01:55:48,692\nenlever ca\na ta mere.\n\n1902\n01:55:48,859 --> 01:55:50,444\nElle a sacrifie sa vie\npour proteger\n\n1903\n01:55:50,527 --> 01:55:52,362\nune jeune fille\nde la tribu perdue.\n\n1904\n01:55:53,738 --> 01:55:56,408\nTon pere,\nc'etait un hypocrite.\n\n1905\n01:55:57,909 --> 01:55:59,661\nIl aurait tue cette fille.\n\n1906\n01:56:00,370 --> 01:56:02,289\nMerde, il a tue\nson propre frere.\n\n1907\n01:56:03,874 --> 01:56:06,543\nT'Challa etait trop noble.\n\n1908\n01:56:08,712 --> 01:56:11,047\nIl a laisse vivre l'homme\nqui a tue ton pere.\n\n1909\n01:56:13,175 --> 01:56:14,843\nEt te voila.\n\n1910\n01:56:20,515 --> 01:56:22,642\nTu vas etre noble\ncomme ton frere\n\n1911\n01:56:22,809 --> 01:56:24,895\nou regler les choses...\n\n1912\n01:56:25,604 --> 01:56:26,730\ncomme moi ?\n\n1913\n01:56:28,398 --> 01:56:29,483\n(CRIE)\n\n1914\n01:56:29,566 --> 01:56:30,567\nNAKIA : Ca va ?\n\n1915\n01:56:30,984 --> 01:56:32,652\n(SUFFOQUE)\n\n1916\n01:56:32,736 --> 01:56:33,904\n(EN XHOSA)\n\n1917\n01:56:36,448 --> 01:56:37,532\n(EN ANGLAIS) Qui as-tu vu ?\n\n1918\n01:56:43,038 --> 01:56:44,039\nPersonne.\n\n1919\n01:56:47,292 --> 01:56:48,293\n(EN XHOSA)\n\n1920\n01:56:48,919 --> 01:56:50,337\n(EN ANGLAIS) J'ai echoue.\n\n1921\n01:56:50,504 --> 01:56:52,631\n-Ca n'a pas marche.\n-Shuri.\n\n1922\n01:56:55,759 --> 01:56:58,136\n-Ils m'ont abandonnee.\n-Ils ne feraient jamais ca.\n\n1923\n01:56:58,220 --> 01:56:59,763\nJ'ai fait tout ce qu'il fallait.\n\n1924\n01:56:59,846 --> 01:57:01,681\n-J'ai recree l'Herbe.\n-D'accord.\n\n1925\n01:57:01,765 --> 01:57:03,808\nJ'ai fait votre stupide rituel,\net pour quoi ?\n\n1926\n01:57:03,975 --> 01:57:05,519\n-Calme-toi.\n-Pourquoi ne sont-ils pas venus ?\n\n1927\n01:57:05,602 --> 01:57:06,728\nCalme-toi.\n\n1928\n01:57:09,481 --> 01:57:10,941\n(GROGNE DE FRUSTRATION)\n\n1929\n01:57:13,818 --> 01:57:15,111\nTOUTES DEUX : Merde.\n\n1930\n01:57:19,449 --> 01:57:20,784\nJe peux en avoir aussi ?\n\n1931\n01:57:28,208 --> 01:57:29,251\nJe crois...\n\n1932\n01:57:30,794 --> 01:57:32,254\nqu'il va te falloir un costume.\n\n1933\n01:57:35,507 --> 01:57:37,717\n(MUSIQUE PENSIVE)\n\n1934\n01:57:51,147 --> 01:57:53,483\n(MUSIQUE SYNTHETIQUE LENTE)\n\n1935\n01:58:03,868 --> 01:58:05,870\nANCIEN DE TRIBU 1 :\nD'autres gens arrivent de la ville.\n\n1936\n01:58:05,954 --> 01:58:07,581\nM'BAKU : Ils ont besoin\nde plus d'espace.\n\n1937\n01:58:07,747 --> 01:58:08,748\nEt alors ?\n\n1938\n01:58:09,624 --> 01:58:11,876\nVous etes des visiteurs.\n\n1939\n01:58:12,043 --> 01:58:15,255\nJe me demande comment on arrive\na faire quoi que ce soit avec vous.\n\n1940\n01:58:15,338 --> 01:58:16,339\n(HESITE)\n\n1941\n01:58:17,173 --> 01:58:18,675\n(RONRONNEMENT DU MOTEUR)\n\n1942\n01:58:24,806 --> 01:58:27,017\n(MUSIQUE SYNTHETIQUE LENTE)\n\n1943\n01:58:40,405 --> 01:58:42,699\n-(TOUS S'EXCLAMENT)\n-ANCIEN DE TRIBU 2 : La princesse !\n\n1944\n01:58:53,668 --> 01:58:55,128\n(M'BAKU SE RACLE LA GORGE)\n\n1945\n01:58:57,047 --> 01:58:59,382\n(LES JABARI HULULENT)\n\n1946\n01:59:02,510 --> 01:59:04,512\n(LA MUSIQUE S'INTENSIFIE)\n\n1947\n01:59:04,596 --> 01:59:06,097\n(LES HULULEMENTS CONTINUENT)\n\n1948\n01:59:13,021 --> 01:59:14,314\n(LES HULULEMENTS S'APAISENT)\n\n1949\n01:59:16,232 --> 01:59:17,525\nM'BAKU : Elle a reussi !\n\n1950\n01:59:18,234 --> 01:59:21,237\n-La Black Panther vit !\n-(LES JABARI POUSSENT DES CRIS)\n\n1951\n01:59:21,321 --> 01:59:24,324\n-(LES JABARI CHANTENT)\n-(ZAWAVARI CHANTE EN XHOSA)\n\n1952\n01:59:28,370 --> 01:59:30,538\n(LES JABARI CONTINUENT\nDE CHANTER)\n\n1953\n01:59:39,089 --> 01:59:41,508\nNamor croit\nque Wakanda est a genoux.\n\n1954\n01:59:43,968 --> 01:59:45,428\nNotre reine assassinee.\n\n1955\n01:59:47,931 --> 01:59:49,474\nNotre capitale detruite.\n\n1956\n01:59:51,142 --> 01:59:52,977\nIl croit que nous n'avons\nplus de protecteur.\n\n1957\n01:59:54,979 --> 01:59:55,980\nMais maintenant...\n\n1958\n01:59:57,774 --> 01:59:59,776\nil est temps pour nous\nde frapper.\n\n1959\n01:59:59,943 --> 02:00:03,530\nANCIEN : Comment,\nsi nous ignorons ou le trouver ?\n\n1960\n02:00:04,114 --> 02:00:05,824\nNous ferons venir Namor a nous.\n\n1961\n02:00:05,990 --> 02:00:07,534\n-Ici, encore ?\n-SHURI : Non.\n\n1962\n02:00:07,701 --> 02:00:10,036\nDans un lieu isole,\nen mer.\n\n1963\n02:00:10,203 --> 02:00:11,621\nM'BAKU : Tres bien.\n\n1964\n02:00:11,705 --> 02:00:13,164\nAdmettons que ca marche.\n\n1965\n02:00:14,457 --> 02:00:17,210\nSi nous arrivons a tuer\ncet homme\n\n1966\n02:00:17,377 --> 02:00:20,422\nqui vole et semble aussi fort\nque Hulk...\n\n1967\n02:00:23,174 --> 02:00:25,593\nl'assassiner est-il\nla bonne solution ?\n\n1968\n02:00:26,052 --> 02:00:28,012\nANCIEN DE TRIBU 2 :\nVous reclamiez sa tete\n\n1969\n02:00:28,179 --> 02:00:30,515\nquand son seul crime\netait l'intimidation.\n\n1970\n02:00:30,682 --> 02:00:32,475\nQu'est-ce qui a change,\nSeigneur M'Baku ?\n\n1971\n02:00:32,642 --> 02:00:33,852\nSes soldats\n\n1972\n02:00:34,018 --> 02:00:35,729\nne l'appelaient pas\ngeneral ou roi.\n\n1973\n02:00:35,812 --> 02:00:38,481\nIls l'appelaient K'uk'ulkan.\n\n1974\n02:00:38,648 --> 02:00:39,858\nQu'est-ce que c'est ?\n\n1975\n02:00:40,024 --> 02:00:42,152\nLe dieu serpent a plumes.\n\n1976\n02:00:42,736 --> 02:00:43,737\nQuoi ?\n\n1977\n02:00:43,820 --> 02:00:45,822\nVous croyez que parce que\nnous vivons dans les montagnes,\n\n1978\n02:00:45,989 --> 02:00:47,866\nnous n'avons pas acces\naux livres ?\n\n1979\n02:00:48,116 --> 02:00:49,617\n-(RIT)\n-SHURI : Anciens,\n\n1980\n02:00:50,034 --> 02:00:51,411\navec votre permission,\n\n1981\n02:00:51,578 --> 02:00:55,290\nj'aimerais parler seule\navec le Seigneur M'Baku.\n\n1982\n02:00:56,666 --> 02:00:57,667\n(LES ANCIENS PARLENT XHOSA)\n\n1983\n02:01:05,425 --> 02:01:06,760\n(EN ANGLAIS)\nNamor n'en a pas fini.\n\n1984\n02:01:08,178 --> 02:01:11,264\nIl a promis de detruire\nle monde de la surface.\n\n1985\n02:01:11,431 --> 02:01:13,767\nC'est notre chance\nde l'arreter.\n\n1986\n02:01:13,933 --> 02:01:16,186\n-De quoi as-tu peur ?\n-M'BAKU : De la guerre.\n\n1987\n02:01:16,603 --> 02:01:19,939\nSi Namor est vraiment\nun dieu pour son peuple,\n\n1988\n02:01:20,106 --> 02:01:22,734\nle tuer risque de provoquer\nune guerre eternelle.\n\n1989\n02:01:22,817 --> 02:01:23,985\nSHURI : Et alors ?\n\n1990\n02:01:24,527 --> 02:01:26,863\nLa vie de ma mere ne valait pas\nune guerre eternelle ?\n\n1991\n02:01:27,030 --> 02:01:28,406\nM'BAKU : Bien sur que si.\n\n1992\n02:01:29,407 --> 02:01:33,495\nBien sur qu'elle le valait.\n\n1993\n02:01:35,497 --> 02:01:38,708\nMais ce n'est pas ce\nqu'elle aurait voulu pour toi.\n\n1994\n02:01:39,959 --> 02:01:40,960\nHmm ?\n\n1995\n02:01:44,172 --> 02:01:45,882\nEt ce n'est pas ce que je veux...\n\n1996\n02:01:48,510 --> 02:01:50,261\npour mon peuple.\n\n1997\n02:01:58,228 --> 02:02:00,522\n(MUSIQUE SOMBRE)\n\n1998\n02:02:00,605 --> 02:02:03,650\nTu parles de ma mere\ncomme si elle etait encore la.\n\n1999\n02:02:04,567 --> 02:02:06,569\nDe ce qu'elle aurait voulu\npour moi.\n\n2000\n02:02:07,654 --> 02:02:09,948\nDe ses espoirs et de ses reves.\n\n2001\n02:02:13,117 --> 02:02:14,619\nMais elle est morte.\n\n2002\n02:02:15,662 --> 02:02:16,663\nElle est partie !\n\n2003\n02:02:18,373 --> 02:02:22,252\nNamor l'a noyee\nsous mes yeux !\n\n2004\n02:02:23,670 --> 02:02:24,963\nAlors ses reves,\n\n2005\n02:02:25,129 --> 02:02:28,216\nses buts, ses espoirs pour moi...\n\n2006\n02:02:31,553 --> 02:02:32,804\nca n'existe pas.\n\n2007\n02:02:35,515 --> 02:02:37,058\nCa n'a plus d'importance.\n\n2008\n02:02:39,143 --> 02:02:42,021\nCe qui compte,\nc'est ce que je veux,\n\n2009\n02:02:42,188 --> 02:02:44,899\net ce que je veux,\nc'est la mort de Namor !\n\n2010\n02:02:48,903 --> 02:02:50,572\nEt tu vas m'aider\na l'obtenir.\n\n2011\n02:02:58,121 --> 02:02:59,289\n(EN XHOSA)\n\n2012\n02:03:04,002 --> 02:03:05,128\n(GROGNE)\n\n2013\n02:03:06,838 --> 02:03:08,464\n(EN ANGLAIS)\nNous partons demain matin.\n\n2014\n02:03:11,050 --> 02:03:13,261\n(MUSIQUE DE PERCUSSIONS TENDUE)\n\n2015\n02:03:34,282 --> 02:03:35,283\nNAKIA : Salut.\n\n2016\n02:03:35,450 --> 02:03:36,451\nBonjour.\n\n2017\n02:03:39,078 --> 02:03:40,288\nSi nous survivons,\n\n2018\n02:03:41,956 --> 02:03:45,168\nsache que t