402\nhein ?\n\n1847\n01:52:23,570 --> 01:52:25,405\n-(LES PERLES KIMOYO VIBRENT)\n-Hein ?\n\n1848\n01:52:26,907 --> 01:52:29,076\n(LONG SOUPIR)\n\n1849\n01:52:30,369 --> 01:52:34,206\nQue cette Herbe-Cœur\n\n1850\n01:52:34,581 --> 01:52:37,626\nte donne la force\nde la Black Panther\n\n1851\n01:52:38,043 --> 01:52:40,462\net te mène\nau Plan ancestral.\n\n1852\n01:52:44,716 --> 01:52:46,051\n(EN XHOSA)\n\n1853\n01:52:49,805 --> 01:52:52,057\n(LÀ MUSIQUE DE SUSPENSE MONTE)\n\n1854\n01:52:54,309 --> 01:52:55,310\n(LÀ MUSIQUE S'ARRÊTE)\n\n1855\n01:52:57,646 --> 01:52:58,981\n(NAKIÀ CHANTE EN XHOSA)\n\n1856\n01:53:00,649 --> 01:53:02,192\n(NAKIÀ ET RIRI\nCHANTENT EN XHOSA)\n\n1857\n01:53:02,276 --> 01:53:03,986\n(BATTEMENTS DE COEUR)\n\n1858\n01:53:10,284 --> 01:53:11,285\n(LE COEUR S'ARRÊTE)\n\n1859\n01:53:31,930 --> 01:53:33,432\n(HALETE)\n\n1860\n01:53:33,515 --> 01:53:35,851\n(MUSIQUE SOURDE ET INQUIETANTE)\n\n1861\n01:53:59,750 --> 01:54:00,751\n(EN ANGLAIS) Mère ?\n\n1862\n01:54:14,097 --> 01:54:15,349\nN'Jadaka.\n\n1863\n01:54:15,932 --> 01:54:17,100\nPetite cousine.\n\n1864\n01:54:17,476 --> 01:54:18,477\nComment ?\n\n1865\n01:54:18,560 --> 01:54:21,396\nLe comment compte moins\nque le pourquoi, non ?\n\n1866\n01:54:23,190 --> 01:54:24,441\nTu m'as choisi.\n\n1867\n01:54:24,608 --> 01:54:27,486\nImpossible.\nJe ne te choisirais jamais.\n\n1868\n01:54:27,652 --> 01:54:29,321\nPourquoi as-tu pris l'Herbe ?\n\n1869\n01:54:30,322 --> 01:54:32,282\n-Pour voir ma famille.\n-Non, conneries.\n\n1870\n01:54:33,241 --> 01:54:35,160\nTu ne croyais pas\nau Plan ancestral,\n\n1871\n01:54:35,243 --> 01:54:36,244\nsi ?\n\n1872\n01:54:39,373 --> 01:54:40,374\n"}}
{"timestamp":"2026-05-26T23:35:57.678Z","ordinal":51,"type":"response_item","payload":{"type":"function_call_output","call_id":"call_9bIX7zZwWdNae0hjxqEGNHCp","output":"Chunk ID: dad8bc\nWall time: 0.0000 seconds\nProcess exited with code 0\nOriginal token count: 938\nOutput:\n01:58:17,173 --> 01:58:18,675\n(RONRONNEMENT DU MOTEUR)\n\n1942\n01:58:24,806 --> 01:58:27,017\n(MUSIQUE SYNTHÉTIQUE LENTE)\n\n1943\n01:58:40,405 --> 01:58:42,699\n-(TOUS S'EXCLAMENT)\n-ANCIEN DE TRIBU 2 : La princesse !\n\n1944\n01:58:53,668 --> 01:58:55,128\n(M'BAKU SE RACLE LÀ GORGE)\n\n1945\n01:58:57,047 --> 01:58:59,382\n(LES JABARI HULULENT)\n\n1946\n01:59:02,510 --> 01:59:04,512\n(LÀ MUSIQUE S'INTENSIFIE)\n\n1947\n01:59:04,596 --> 01:59:06,097\n(LES HULULEMENTS CONTINUENT)\n\n1948\n01:59:13,021 --> 01:59:14,314\n(LES HULULEMENTS S'APAISENT)\n\n1949\n01:59:16,232 --> 01:59:17,525\nM'BAKU : Elle a réussi !\n\n1950\n01:59:18,234 --> 01:59:21,237\n-La Black Panther vit !\n-(LES JABARI POUSSENT DES CRIS)\n\n1951\n01:59:21,321 --> 01:59:24,324\n-(LES JABARI CHANTENT)\n-(ZAWAVARI CHANTE EN XHOSA)\n\n1952\n01:59:28,370 --> 01:59:30,538\n(LES JABARI CONTINUENT\nDE CHANTER)\n\n1953\n01:59:39,089 --> 01:59:41,508\nNamor croit\nque Wakanda est à genoux.\n\n1954\n01:59:43,968 --> 01:59:45,428\nNotre reine assassinee.\n\n1955\n01:59:47,931 --> 01:59:49,474\nNotre çapitale détruite.\n\n1956\n01:59:51,142 --> 01:59:52,977\nIl croit que nous n'avons\nplus de protecteur.\n\n1957\n01:59:54,979 --> 01:59:55,980\nMais maintenant...\n\n1958\n01:59:57,774 --> 01:59:59,776\nil est temps pour nous\nde frapper.\n\n1959\n01:59:59,943 --> 02:00:03,530\nANCIEN : Comment,\nsi nous ignorons où le trouver ?\n\n1960\n02:00:04,114 --> 02:00:05,824\nNous ferons venir Namor à nous.\n\n1961\n02:00:05,990 --> 02:00:07,534\n-Ici, encore ?\n-SHURI : Non.\n\n1962\n02:00:07,701 --> 02:00:10,036\nDans un lieu isole,\nen mer.\n\n1963\n02:00:10,203 --> 02:00:11,621\nM'BAKU : Très bien.\n\n1964\n02:00:11,705 --> 02:00:13,164\nAdmettons que cà marche.\n\n1965\n02:00:14,457 --> 02:00:17,210\nSi nous arrivons à tuer\ncet homme\n\n1966\n02:00:17,377 --> 02:00:20,422\nqui vole et semble aussi fort\nque Hulk...\n\n1967\n02:00:23,174 --> 02:00:25,593\nl'assassiner est-il\nla bonne solution ?\n\n1968\n02:00:26,052 --> 02:00:28,012\nANCIEN DE TRIBU 2 :\nVous reclamiez sà tété\n\n1969\n02:00:28,179 --> 02:00:30,515\nquand son seul crime\nétait l'intimidation.\n\n1970\n02:00:30,682 --> 02:00:32,475\nQu'est-ce qui a change,\nSeigneur M'Baku ?\n\n1971\n02:00:32,642 --> 02:00:33,852\nSes soldats\n\n1972\n02:00:34,018 --> 02:00:35,729\nne l'appelaient pas\ngêneral ou roi.\n\n1973\n02:00:35,812 --> 02:00:38,481\nIls l'appelaient K'uk'ulkan.\n\n1974\n02:00:38,648 --> 02:00:39,858\nQu'est-ce que c'est ?\n\n1975\n02:00:40,024 --> 02:00:42,152\nLe dieu serpent a plumes.\n\n1976\n02:00:42,736 --> 02:00:43,737\nQuoi ?\n\n1977\n02:00:43,820 --> 02:00:45,822\nVous croyez que parce que\nnous vivons dans les montagnes,\n\n1978\n02:00:45,989 --> 02:00:47,866\nnous n'avons pas accès\naux livres ?\n\n1979\n02:00:48,116 --> 02:00:49,617\n-(RIT)\n-SHURI : Anciens,\n\n1980\n02:00:50,034 --> 02:00:51,411\navec votre permission,\n\n1981\n02:00:51,578 --> 02:00:55,290\nj'aimerais parler seule\navec le Seigneur M'Baku.\n\n1982\n02:00:56,666 --> 02:00:57,667\n(LES ANCIENS PARLENT XHOSA)\n\n1983\n02:01:05,425 --> 02:01:06,760\n(EN ANGLAIS)\nNamor n'en a pas fini.\n\n1984\n02:01:08,178 --> 02:01:11,264\nIl a promis de détruire\nle monde de la surface.\n\n1985\n02:01:11,431 --> 02:01:13,767\nC'est notre chance\nde l'arrêter.\n\n1986\n02:01:13,933 --> 02:01:16,186\n-De quoi as-tu peur ?\n-M'BAKU : De la guerre.\n\n1987\n02:01:16,603 --> 02:01:19,939\nSi Namor est vraiment\nun dieu pour son peuple,\n\n1988\n02:01:20,106 --> 02:01:22,734\nle tuer risque de provoquer\nune guerre étérnelle.\n\n1989\n02:01:22,817 --> 02:01:23,985\nSHURI : Et alors ?\n\n1990\n02:01:24,527 --> 02:01:26,863\nLa vie de ma mère ne valait pas\nune guerre étérn